          description : "6.2.3.23 Ensure login and logout events are collected"
          info        : "Monitor login and logout events. The parameters below track changes to files associated with login/logout events.

 - /var/log/lastlog - maintain records of the last time a user successfully logged in.
 - /var/run/faillock - directory maintains records of login failures via the pam_faillock module.

Monitoring login/logout events could provide a system administrator with information associated with brute force attacks against user logins.

Satisfies: SRG-OS-000062-GPOS-00031, SRG-OS-000037-GPOS-00015, SRG-OS-000042-GPOS-00020, SRG-OS-000062-GPOS-00031, SRG-OS-000392-GPOS-00172, SRG-OS-000462-GPOS-00206, SRG-OS-000471-GPOS-00215, SRG-OS-000473-GPOS-00218"
          solution    : "Note:

